     Cell[BoxData[
     "DeNoise"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "e1c5b5e5-c613-4c4e-bd3a-4ef37107d95a"],
     "Monitor is and option for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "DeNoise"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "48bd66b1-d375-cf4a-b281-0e6a30103d1a"],
     ". Monitor the denoising progress."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"1b3d7eb9-0323-a947-bc59-c82a625b2428"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
